hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15997","Ali ibn Asim narrated to us, he said, Khalid al-Hadhdha informed me, from Abu Qilaba, from Amr ibn Salima, he said: Riders used to come to us from the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), and we would ask them to recite to us, and they would narrate to us that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Let the one of you with most Quran lead you."
